        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 26N-36, 1\" x 36\" Neoprene Door Shoe</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDoor shoe use to close and seal the bottom gap on a under cut door. These 36 inch long door shoes are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used on 1-3/4\" thick doors. It includes Black Neoprene Seal on the bottom to seal the door against the threshold. Slotted screw holes for easy height adjustments.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOptional Anodized Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.  Packaged with #6 x 3/4\" stainless steel sheet metal screws. Very good resistance to ozone, sunlight and aging. Flame and moisture resistant with a temperature range -20 F to 200 F. Certified by UL to CAN/ULC-S104 and ANSI/UL10B, complies with NFPA 80 and NFPA 252 for application to Hollow Metal fire doors rated up to 3 Hrs., and Wood fire doors rated up to 90 minutes. ANSI/BHMA CERTIFIED. Certified Gasketing complies with American National Standard for Door Gasketing and Edge Sealing Systems ANSI/BHMA A156.22\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for 26N-36  Neoprene Door Shoe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Seal Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Neoprene Seal: Black</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Aluminum or Dark Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #6 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel SMS</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/26N_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262398\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 26N Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
